<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA JAN NET UP TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA JAN NET UP TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.08 vs   0.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.60 vs   1.28</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.65 vs   1.49</p>
<p> Sales		   16.01 vs  15.29</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is</p>
<p>Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
